			"date": "2024-01-03T19:35:59.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I remember when things went pretty quiet last year and I was worried about you. I’m glad to see that things have gotten better and that you've got a good balance. We're blessed to have you doing what you do.</p>",
