			},
			"date": "2024-01-03T19:38:41.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> re: final paragraph of “Down for the Count” – you're being WAY too hard on yourself.</p><p>Something approaching a worst case scenario occurred, but after the dust settled Eleventy was pretty much fine _because_ of the choices you'd made about its relationship to funding. You don’t have to look very hard to find another SSG that made different choices and is reaping what it sowed. (or, uh, it was reaped?)</p><p>As far as I'm concerned, it’s a model project and you handled it great!</p>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
